  "observation": "A cold boot through the guarded field 23 adapter, followed only by ordinary inputs, reaches actor 14 interaction event 2, a four-enemy battle, victory, experience and item rewards, field return, movement and the party menu. The trace compares one complete event-slot insertion and six opcode 71 calls: five music-result retries and one accepted selector-zero request. All 124 whole-run control artifacts are identical.",
  "interpretation": "This establishes a repeatable original encounter route and bounds the observed contact-slot and battle-request stores. The successful field return preserves the player position before subsequent ordinary movement. These observations supply a concrete route for combat, reward, menu and lifecycle reconstruction; they do not establish those complete semantics.",
  "confidence": "supported",
  "validation": {
    "preconditions": [
      "Use the exact selected Disc 1 source and pinned Nix observation-trace environment. Keep original payload private.",
      "Keep the existing guarded field adapter separate from ordinary gameplay; this route adds no setup writes. Use fresh private capture and report names when reproducing."
    ],
    "commands": [
      "nix --extra-experimental-features 'nix-command flakes' develop path:./nix#observation-trace",
      "python tools/reference/scenario.py tests/reference-inputs/field23-encounter-observation.json --content \"discs/Xenogears disc 1.chd\" --output <new-private-control>",
      "env PYTHONPATH=. python .local/analysis/phase1-field-interaction-20260908/prepare-request-v1.py (use a fresh spec output name)",
      "python tools/reference/scenario.py tests/reference-inputs/field23-encounter-observation.json --content \"discs/Xenogears disc 1.chd\" --trace-instructions <source-qualified-spec> --output <new-private-trace>",
      "env PYTHONPATH=. python .local/analysis/phase1-field-interaction-20260908/audit-route-v1.py (point at the new captures and fresh report names)",
      "env PYTHONPATH=. python .local/analysis/phase1-field-interaction-20260908/negative-route-v1.py (use the corresponding comparison and fresh output names)",
      "python tools/analysis/verify_field.py --raw .local/references/source-1/disc.bin --ram <new-private-trace>/capture/ram-005902.bin --profile na-slus-00664-39c547a9afc6 --map 23 --output <new-private-source-comparison>; repeat for return frames 10762 and 10794",
      "python tools/repository/check.py"
    ],
    "expected": "Exact source-qualified slot/request state changes and complete control equality, with visible victory, reward, field-return and menu checkpoints. Reject corruptions; retain the full Phase 1 backlog.",
    "actual": "One event-2 insertion at frontend run 5903 and all six opcode-71 state changes match. The accepted selector is zero at run 5915. All 15 deliberately corrupted traces are rejected. All 124 capture artifacts match the control exactly. Source comparison passes before battle and twice after return. The final menu shows Fei level 2 with HP 50/56 and EP 10/11, Citan level 3 with HP 200/200 and EP 40/40, and 100 G.",
    "result": "passed",
    "tolerance": "Exact integer and sampled-byte equality, complete images/audio/RAM/external state, no masks. Visual reward observations do not establish formulas or native simulation timing.",
